  "sourceRequirements": {
    "summary": "Articles report original research of international importance, with a structured abstract and an explicit Research in context panel.\n\nDistilled requirements: Body up to 3,000 words; abstract up to 250 words; up to 4 figures; up to 4 tables; up to 60 references; required sections: Introduction, Methods, Results, Discussion; Vancouver citation style.\n\nAlso required: Structured abstract: Background, Methods, Findings, Interpretation, Funding; Research in context panel required (Evidence before this study / Added value / Implications); Declaration of interests required for all authors.\n\nThis summary is the app's distillation \u2014 open the author instructions above to confirm against the journal's current text.",
